{"3980550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Who Am I", "steam_appid": 3980550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[WHO AM I]</strong> is a story-driven first-person horror game where you step into the shoes of a protagonist who has forgotten who they are and what they've done, uncovering a hideous past to confront the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Synopsis </strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening from a recurring dream, you find yourself trapped in a repeating day. The end of each day inevitably leads to an inexplicable, agonizing nightmare. It reveals scenes that are eerily familiar, yet are things you never wanted to witness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this the truth you’ve been trying to avoid? Or is it mere delusion? Face the truth that slowly unravels as the days repeat. Who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Key Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Dream</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the place you fell asleep in a dream, or reality? Search for clues within the repeating nightmares to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/9ef2995324e04c74dbc7c66735ff44ae.poster.avif?t=1781162463\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/9ef2995324e04c74dbc7c66735ff44ae.webm?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/9ef2995324e04c74dbc7c66735ff44ae.mp4?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Anomalies</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days repeat, reality becomes bizarrely distorted, and things that were once unseen begin to manifest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/1ad9df5f8d59de3603cd62bbecb2e76f.poster.avif?t=1781162463\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/1ad9df5f8d59de3603cd62bbecb2e76f.webm?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/1ad9df5f8d59de3603cd62bbecb2e76f.mp4?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Clues to the Truth</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you, and what exactly happened that day? Search for hidden clues scattered throughout to uncover your true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/7a66ea87cc70c66cea1e0301a38e6c2c.poster.avif?t=1781162463\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/7a66ea87cc70c66cea1e0301a38e6c2c.webm?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/7a66ea87cc70c66cea1e0301a38e6c2c.mp4?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices lead to 3 completely different endings.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items hidden in the dark and choose carefully at every moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The decisions you make and the clues you collect will determine the final ending.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[WHO AM I]</strong> is a story-driven first-person horror game where you step into the shoes of a protagonist who has forgotten who they are and what they've done, uncovering a hideous past to confront the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Synopsis </strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening from a recurring dream, you find yourself trapped in a repeating day. The end of each day inevitably leads to an inexplicable, agonizing nightmare. It reveals scenes that are eerily familiar, yet are things you never wanted to witness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this the truth you’ve been trying to avoid? Or is it mere delusion? Face the truth that slowly unravels as the days repeat. Who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Key Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Dream</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the place you fell asleep in a dream, or reality? Search for clues within the repeating nightmares to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/9ef2995324e04c74dbc7c66735ff44ae.poster.avif?t=1781162463\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/9ef2995324e04c74dbc7c66735ff44ae.webm?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/9ef2995324e04c74dbc7c66735ff44ae.mp4?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Anomalies</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days repeat, reality becomes bizarrely distorted, and things that were once unseen begin to manifest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/1ad9df5f8d59de3603cd62bbecb2e76f.poster.avif?t=1781162463\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/1ad9df5f8d59de3603cd62bbecb2e76f.webm?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/1ad9df5f8d59de3603cd62bbecb2e76f.mp4?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Clues to the Truth</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you, and what exactly happened that day? Search for hidden clues scattered throughout to uncover your true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/7a66ea87cc70c66cea1e0301a38e6c2c.poster.avif?t=1781162463\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/7a66ea87cc70c66cea1e0301a38e6c2c.webm?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/extras/7a66ea87cc70c66cea1e0301a38e6c2c.mp4?t=1781162463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices lead to 3 completely different endings.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items hidden in the dark and choose carefully at every moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The decisions you make and the clues you collect will determine the final ending.</p>", "short_description": "Lost in amnesia, face a horrific past rising from nightmares. Uncover the truth hidden in a diary. In this psychological horror where reality and hallucination blur, piece together memories before madness consumes you. When the truth is out, ask yourself: Who was I?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/4f663d0e20fcb4bf03d209a9c45edcf9f399b991/header.jpg?t=1781162463", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/4232752aed1c9f9f68c9947e7f6759df54863ce2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781162463", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980550/4232752aed1c9f9f68c9947e7f6759df54863ce2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781162463", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 280<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Keyboard and mouse required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window